  "name": "Beat of the Frontier launch tournament",
  "category": "event",
  "description": {
    "text": "The tournaments held in March 2009 to launch the Beat of the Frontier expansion (フロンティアの鼓動), whose logo their cards carry. At the Card Get Battle version, a first win brought Battle Tower 019/DPt-P and further wins Dragonite FB 018/DPt-P. At the version that shops ran as a Gym Challenge, every player got Battle Tower and SP Energy 020/DPt-P, and the top finishers got Drifblim FB 017/DPt-P. Dragonite and Drifblim are Frontier Brains' SP Pokémon, marked FB after their names, and SP Energy counts as every type while attached to an SP Pokémon.",
